{
 "events": [
  {
   "id": "U1",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 0.2,
   "end": 5.65,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     0.2,
     "In 24 hours, the world ends."
    ],
    [
     3.2,
     "Do exactly what I say, and you'll live."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N1",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 6.38,
   "end": 11.18,
   "text": "The day before the world ended... I got a text, from a number I didn't know."
  },
  {
   "id": "N2",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 11.68,
   "end": 14.88,
   "text": "I thought it was a prank. Until the next text came in."
  },
  {
   "id": "U2",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 15.37,
   "end": 17.42,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     15.37,
     "You're wearing the orange scarf right now."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N3",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 18.45,
   "end": 20.65,
   "text": "I was. And I was home alone."
  },
  {
   "id": "U3",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 22.84,
   "end": 29.69,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     22.84,
     "Don't go to school tomorrow."
    ],
    [
     24.94,
     "Tonight: buy water, canned food, batteries."
    ],
    [
     28.34,
     "Go. NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H1",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 30.24,
   "end": 31.715,
   "text": "who is this??"
  },
  {
   "id": "U4",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 31.965,
   "end": 34.415,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     31.965,
     "No time."
    ],
    [
     33.865,
     "Trust me."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N4",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 35.245,
   "end": 42.745,
   "text": "So I went. The store was almost empty. The cashier kept coughing. And his eyes... were yellow."
  },
  {
   "id": "U5",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 43.235,
   "end": 49.185,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     43.235,
     "Don't touch him."
    ],
    [
     44.635,
     "Go home."
    ],
    [
     46.435,
     "Lock your door at exactly 11:58."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N5",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 50.115,
   "end": 52.315,
   "text": "At 11:58, I locked the door."
  },
  {
   "id": "N6",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 53.135,
   "end": 57.235,
   "text": "At 11:59, every phone in the city started screaming."
  },
  {
   "id": "N7",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 57.955,
   "end": 59.655,
   "text": "Then the real screaming started."
  },
  {
   "id": "U6",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 60.645,
   "end": 66.595,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     60.645,
     "RULE 1: Don't open the door. For anyone."
    ],
    [
     65.245,
     "Not even people you know."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N8",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 67.625,
   "end": 73.425,
   "text": "On day 3, someone knocked. It was Mr. Hale, my neighbor. He was begging me to let him in."
  },
  {
   "id": "N9",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 74.045,
   "end": 77.145,
   "text": "My hand was already on the lock... when my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U7",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 77.635,
   "end": 78.185,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     77.635,
     "Don't."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N10",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 79.715,
   "end": 84.815,
   "text": "I didn't open it. 10 seconds later, he stopped begging. And started scratching."
  },
  {
   "id": "U8",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 85.805,
   "end": 90.055,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     85.805,
     "RULE 2: The roof. 3 AM."
    ],
    [
     89.505,
     "Come alone."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N11",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 90.885,
   "end": 96.885,
   "text": "At 3 AM, something buzzed over the city. A drone. It dropped a box, right at my feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "N12",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 97.605,
   "end": 105.705,
   "text": "Inside, a radio, a flashlight, and a map. One place was circled in red. The bridge. Day 30."
  },
  {
   "id": "N13",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 106.925,
   "end": 108.825,
   "text": "On day 12, the power died."
  },
  {
   "id": "U9",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 109.315,
   "end": 113.765,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     109.315,
     "RULE 3: They're drawn to light."
    ],
    [
     112.815,
     "Keep the curtains shut."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N14",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 114.495,
   "end": 120.495,
   "text": "Across the street, someone turned on a flashlight. 30 seconds later... it went out. Forever."
  },
  {
   "id": "N15",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 121.715,
   "end": 127.515,
   "text": "Day 18. Trucks came. Men in white suits, with a logo I had never seen before."
  },
  {
   "id": "N16",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 128.135,
   "end": 130.935,
   "text": "They weren't killing the zombies. They were collecting them."
  },
  {
   "id": "N17",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 131.655,
   "end": 134.255,
   "text": "Then one of them looked up. Right at my window."
  },
  {
   "id": "U10",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 134.545,
   "end": 136.595,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     134.545,
     "GET DOWN."
    ],
    [
     136.345,
     "NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N18",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 138.025,
   "end": 140.525,
   "text": "On day 23, I finally asked."
  },
  {
   "id": "H2",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 141.065,
   "end": 143.29,
   "text": "why are you helping me?"
  },
  {
   "id": "U11",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 143.84,
   "end": 144.99,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     143.84,
     "Because I owe you."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H3",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 145.54,
   "end": 146.865,
   "text": "who ARE you"
  },
  {
   "id": "U12",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 147.715,
   "end": 151.365,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     147.715,
     "You used to be scared of thunder."
    ],
    [
     150.715,
     "You still are."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N19",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 152.495,
   "end": 154.795,
   "text": "Nobody knew that. Nobody alive."
  },
  {
   "id": "U13",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 155.785,
   "end": 162.935,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     155.785,
     "Tomorrow. 6 AM."
    ],
    [
     157.785,
     "Get to the bridge."
    ],
    [
     160.185,
     "Don't stop. Don't look back."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N20",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 163.665,
   "end": 165.265,
   "text": "My phone was at 1%."
  },
  {
   "id": "N21",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 166.585,
   "end": 171.685,
   "text": "Day 30. I ran. I didn't stop. And they heard every single step."
  },
  {
   "id": "N22",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 172.405,
   "end": 175.905,
   "text": "I made it to the bridge. It was empty. Nobody was there."
  },
  {
   "id": "N23",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 176.925,
   "end": 179.425,
   "text": "Then my phone buzzed. One last time."
  },
  {
   "id": "U14",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 180.415,
   "end": 181.165,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     180.415,
     "Turn around."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N24",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 183.031,
   "end": 185.631,
   "text": "Behind me... was a man in a white suit."
  },
  {
   "id": "N25",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 187.451,
   "end": 190.451,
   "text": "Who do you think the unknown number is? Follow for part 2."
  }
 ],
 "story_end": 190.991,
